# Build-time settings for TrimCAD. Everything here ends up in the bundle, so it is
# public by definition: no secrets, no tokens.
#
# Where the Support page's button points. Must be a published GitHub Sponsors
# profile, or the page says sponsorship is not switched on rather than offering a
# link that goes nowhere — see src/site.ts and the Support page's copy.
VITE_SPONSOR_URL=https://github.com/sponsors/DropLab-inc
# Cloudflare Web Analytics beacon token. Empty means no analytics at all, which is the state
# until a site exists for the hostname in the Cloudflare dashboard (Analytics & Logs → Web
# Analytics → Add a site). The token is public by design — it ships in the page — so it lives
# here rather than in a secret store. A development host never reports, token or not.
# See src/core/analytics.ts.
VITE_CLOUDFLARE_BEACON=
